{"id":"fr-l01","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":1,"title":"Hello & introductions","phrases":[{"ar":"Bonjour !","roman":"bohn-ZHOOR","en":"Hello! / Good morning!","ur":"السلام علیکم! / صبح بخیر!","note":"Always say it when you walk into a shop. 'zh' as in 'measure'."},{"ar":"Bonsoir !","roman":"bohn-SWAHR","en":"Good evening!","ur":"شام بخیر!"},{"ar":"Salut !","roman":"sah-LÜ","en":"Hi! / Bye! (friends)","ur":"ہائے!","note":"Informal: only with friends."},{"ar":"Comment allez-vous ?","roman":"koh-mahn tah-lay VOO","en":"How are you? (formal)","ur":"آپ کیسے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"Ça va ?","roman":"sah VAH","en":"How's it going?","ur":"کیا حال ہے؟","note":"Answer: Ça va bien. (sah vah byan)"},{"ar":"Très bien, merci. Et vous ?","roman":"tray byan, mair-SEE. ay VOO","en":"Very well, thanks. And you?","ur":"بہت اچھا، شکریہ۔ اور آپ؟"},{"ar":"Je m'appelle Shakeel.","roman":"zhuh mah-PELL Shakeel","en":"My name is Shakeel.","ur":"میرا نام شکیل ہے۔"},{"ar":"Comment vous appelez-vous ?","roman":"koh-mahn voo zah-play VOO","en":"What is your name?","ur":"آپ کا نام کیا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Je viens du Pakistan.","roman":"zhuh vyan dü pah-kee-STAHN","en":"I come from Pakistan.","ur":"میں پاکستان سے ہوں۔"},{"ar":"J'habite à Dubaï.","roman":"zhah-BEET ah doo-BY","en":"I live in Dubai.","ur":"میں دبئی میں رہتا ہوں۔","note":"French 'h' is silent."},{"ar":"Enchanté !","roman":"ahn-shahn-TAY","en":"Nice to meet you!","ur":"آپ سے مل کر خوشی ہوئی!","note":"Nasal 'an': say 'ahn' through the nose, don't pronounce the n."},{"ar":"Au revoir !","roman":"oh ruh-VWAHR","en":"Goodbye!","ur":"خدا حافظ!"}]},
{"id":"fr-l02","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":2,"title":"Please, thanks, sorry","phrases":[{"ar":"S'il vous plaît.","roman":"seel voo PLAY","en":"Please.","ur":"براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Merci !","roman":"mair-SEE","en":"Thank you!","ur":"شکریہ!"},{"ar":"Merci beaucoup !","roman":"mair-SEE boh-KOO","en":"Thank you very much!","ur":"بہت بہت شکریہ!"},{"ar":"De rien.","roman":"duh RYAN","en":"You're welcome.","ur":"کوئی بات نہیں۔"},{"ar":"Excusez-moi !","roman":"ex-kü-zay MWAH","en":"Excuse me!","ur":"معاف کیجیے!","note":"To get attention or pass someone."},{"ar":"Pardon !","roman":"par-DOHN","en":"Sorry! / Pardon?","ur":"معاف کیجیے!"},{"ar":"Oui.","roman":"wee","en":"Yes.","ur":"ہاں۔"},{"ar":"Non.","roman":"nohn","en":"No.","ur":"نہیں۔"},{"ar":"Je ne comprends pas.","roman":"zhuh nuh kohm-prahn PAH","en":"I don't understand.","ur":"میں نہیں سمجھا۔"},{"ar":"Vous parlez anglais ?","roman":"voo par-lay ahn-GLAY","en":"Do you speak English?","ur":"کیا آپ انگریزی بولتے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"Plus lentement, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"plü lahnt-MAHN, seel voo PLAY","en":"Slower, please.","ur":"ذرا آہستہ، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Pas de problème.","roman":"pahd proh-BLEM","en":"No problem.","ur":"کوئی مسئلہ نہیں۔"}]},
{"id":"fr-l03","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":3,"title":"Numbers","phrases":[{"ar":"un, deux, trois","roman":"uhn, duh, trwah","en":"one, two, three","ur":"ایک، دو، تین"},{"ar":"quatre, cinq, six","roman":"KAH-truh, sank, sees","en":"four, five, six","ur":"چار، پانچ، چھ"},{"ar":"sept, huit, neuf","roman":"set, weet, nuhf","en":"seven, eight, nine","ur":"سات، آٹھ، نو"},{"ar":"dix","roman":"dees","en":"ten","ur":"دس"},{"ar":"vingt","roman":"van","en":"twenty","ur":"بیس","note":"The 'gt' is silent."},{"ar":"cent","roman":"sahn","en":"one hundred","ur":"سو"},{"ar":"mille","roman":"meel","en":"one thousand","ur":"ہزار"},{"ar":"C'est combien ?","roman":"say kohm-BYAN","en":"How much is it?","ur":"یہ کتنے کا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ça fait dix euros.","roman":"sah fay dee zuh-ROH","en":"That's ten euros.","ur":"یہ دس یورو ہوئے۔"},{"ar":"Chambre numéro douze","roman":"SHAHM-bruh nü-may-ROH dooz","en":"Room number twelve","ur":"کمرہ نمبر بارہ"},{"ar":"soixante-dix","roman":"swah-sahnt-DEES","en":"seventy (60 + 10)","ur":"ستر","note":"French counts 70 as 'sixty-ten' and 80 as 'four-twenties': quatre-vingts."}]},
{"id":"fr-l04","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":4,"title":"Days & time","phrases":[{"ar":"lundi, mardi, mercredi","roman":"luhn-DEE, mar-DEE, mair-kruh-DEE","en":"Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday","ur":"پیر، منگل، بدھ"},{"ar":"jeudi, vendredi","roman":"zhuh-DEE, vahn-druh-DEE","en":"Thursday, Friday","ur":"جمعرات، جمعہ"},{"ar":"samedi, dimanche","roman":"sahm-DEE, dee-MAHNSH","en":"Saturday, Sunday","ur":"ہفتہ، اتوار"},{"ar":"aujourd'hui","roman":"oh-zhoor-DWEE","en":"today","ur":"آج"},{"ar":"demain","roman":"duh-MAN","en":"tomorrow","ur":"کل (آنے والا)"},{"ar":"hier","roman":"yair","en":"yesterday","ur":"کل (گزرا ہوا)"},{"ar":"Quelle heure est-il ?","roman":"kel uhr ay-TEEL","en":"What time is it?","ur":"کیا وقت ہوا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Il est trois heures.","roman":"eel ay trwah ZUHR","en":"It's three o'clock.","ur":"تین بجے ہیں۔"},{"ar":"à neuf heures et demie","roman":"ah nuh vuhr ay duh-MEE","en":"at half past nine","ur":"ساڑھے نو بجے"},{"ar":"le week-end","roman":"luh week-END","en":"the weekend","ur":"ہفتے کا آخر"},{"ar":"Vous êtes libre demain ?","roman":"voo zet LEE-bruh duh-MAN","en":"Are you free tomorrow?","ur":"کیا آپ کل فارغ ہیں؟"}]},
{"id":"fr-l05","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":5,"title":"At the airport","phrases":[{"ar":"Où est la sortie ?","roman":"oo ay lah sor-TEE","en":"Where is the exit?","ur":"باہر نکلنے کا راستہ کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Où sont les bagages ?","roman":"oo sohn lay bah-GAHZH","en":"Where is the baggage?","ur":"سامان کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ma valise n'est pas arrivée.","roman":"mah vah-LEEZ nay pah zah-ree-VAY","en":"My suitcase hasn't arrived.","ur":"میرا سوٹ کیس نہیں آیا۔"},{"ar":"Voici mon passeport.","roman":"vwah-SEE mohn pahs-POR","en":"Here is my passport.","ur":"یہ میرا پاسپورٹ ہے۔"},{"ar":"Je reste une semaine.","roman":"zhuh rest ün suh-MEN","en":"I'm staying one week.","ur":"میں ایک ہفتہ رہوں گا۔"},{"ar":"Je suis ici pour le travail.","roman":"zhuh swee zee-SEE poor luh trah-VY","en":"I'm here for work.","ur":"میں کام کے سلسلے میں آیا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Je suis en vacances.","roman":"zhuh swee zahn vah-KAHNS","en":"I'm on holiday.","ur":"میں چھٹیوں پر ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Où est le train pour Paris ?","roman":"oo ay luh tran poor pah-REE","en":"Where is the train to Paris?","ur":"پیرس کی ٹرین کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Un taxi, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"uhn tahk-SEE, seel voo PLAY","en":"A taxi, please.","ur":"ایک ٹیکسی، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Mon vol est en retard.","roman":"mohn vol ay tahn ruh-TAR","en":"My flight is delayed.","ur":"میری فلائٹ لیٹ ہے۔"}]},
{"id":"fr-l06","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":6,"title":"At the hotel","phrases":[{"ar":"J'ai une réservation.","roman":"zhay ün ray-zair-vah-SYOHN","en":"I have a reservation.","ur":"میری بکنگ ہے۔"},{"ar":"Au nom de Qureshi.","roman":"oh nohn duh koo-RAY-shee","en":"Under the name Qureshi.","ur":"قریشی کے نام پر۔"},{"ar":"Une chambre pour deux nuits.","roman":"ün SHAHM-bruh poor duh NWEE","en":"A room for two nights.","ur":"دو راتوں کے لیے ایک کمرہ۔"},{"ar":"Le petit-déjeuner est compris ?","roman":"luh puh-tee day-zhuh-NAY ay kohm-PREE","en":"Is breakfast included?","ur":"کیا ناشتہ شامل ہے؟"},{"ar":"Le petit-déjeuner est à quelle heure ?","roman":"luh puh-tee day-zhuh-NAY ay tah kel UHR","en":"What time is breakfast?","ur":"ناشتہ کس وقت ہوتا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Quel est le code wifi ?","roman":"kel ay luh kod wee-FEE","en":"What is the Wi-Fi code?","ur":"وائی فائی کا کوڈ کیا ہے؟"},{"ar":"La climatisation ne marche pas.","roman":"lah klee-mah-tee-zah-SYOHN nuh marsh PAH","en":"The air conditioning doesn't work.","ur":"اے سی کام نہیں کر رہا۔"},{"ar":"J'ai besoin d'une serviette.","roman":"zhay buh-ZWAN dün sair-VYET","en":"I need a towel.","ur":"مجھے ایک تولیہ چاہیے۔"},{"ar":"Je dois partir à quelle heure ?","roman":"zhuh dwah par-TEER ah kel UHR","en":"What time do I have to check out?","ur":"مجھے کس وقت جانا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Vous pouvez m'appeler un taxi ?","roman":"voo poo-VAY mah-PLAY uhn tahk-SEE","en":"Can you call me a taxi?","ur":"کیا آپ میرے لیے ٹیکسی بلا سکتے ہیں؟"}]},
{"id":"fr-l07","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":7,"title":"Café & restaurant","phrases":[{"ar":"Une table pour deux, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"ün TAH-bluh poor DUH, seel voo PLAY","en":"A table for two, please.","ur":"دو لوگوں کے لیے میز، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"La carte, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"lah KART, seel voo PLAY","en":"The menu, please.","ur":"مینو، براہ مہربانی۔","note":"'Le menu' in France means a fixed set meal."},{"ar":"Je voudrais un café.","roman":"zhuh voo-DRAY uhn kah-FAY","en":"I'd like a coffee.","ur":"مجھے ایک کافی چاہیے۔","note":"'Je voudrais' is the polite way to order anything."},{"ar":"Une carafe d'eau, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"ün kah-RAHF DOH, seel voo PLAY","en":"A jug of tap water, please.","ur":"پانی کا ایک جگ، براہ مہربانی۔","note":"Tap water is free in restaurants."},{"ar":"Il y a du porc dedans ?","roman":"eel yah dü por duh-DAHN","en":"Is there pork in it?","ur":"کیا اس میں سور کا گوشت ہے؟"},{"ar":"Vous avez un plat végétarien ?","roman":"voo zah-VAY uhn plah vay-zhay-tah-RYAN","en":"Do you have a vegetarian dish?","ur":"کیا آپ کے پاس کوئی سبزی والی ڈش ہے؟"},{"ar":"Vous avez de la viande halal ?","roman":"voo zah-VAY duh lah vyahnd ah-LAHL","en":"Do you have halal meat?","ur":"کیا آپ کے پاس حلال گوشت ہے؟"},{"ar":"Sans alcool, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"sahn zahl-KOL, seel voo PLAY","en":"Without alcohol, please.","ur":"بغیر الکحل کے، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"C'est délicieux !","roman":"say day-lee-SYUH","en":"It's delicious!","ur":"یہ بہت مزے کا ہے!"},{"ar":"L'addition, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"lah-dee-SYOHN, seel voo PLAY","en":"The bill, please.","ur":"بل، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Je peux payer par carte ?","roman":"zhuh puh pay-YAY par KART","en":"Can I pay by card?","ur":"کیا میں کارڈ سے ادائیگی کر سکتا ہوں؟"},{"ar":"Gardez la monnaie.","roman":"gar-DAY lah moh-NAY","en":"Keep the change.","ur":"باقی رکھ لیں۔","note":"Service is included; a small tip is optional."}]},
{"id":"fr-l08","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":8,"title":"Shopping & money","phrases":[{"ar":"Je cherche une veste.","roman":"zhuh shairsh ün VEST","en":"I'm looking for a jacket.","ur":"میں ایک جیکٹ ڈھونڈ رہا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Je regarde seulement, merci.","roman":"zhuh ruh-GARD suhl-MAHN, mair-SEE","en":"I'm just looking, thanks.","ur":"میں بس دیکھ رہا ہوں، شکریہ۔"},{"ar":"Vous l'avez en taille M ?","roman":"voo lah-VAY ahn TY em","en":"Do you have it in size M?","ur":"کیا یہ میڈیم سائز میں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Je peux l'essayer ?","roman":"zhuh puh leh-say-YAY","en":"Can I try it on?","ur":"کیا میں اسے پہن کر دیکھ سکتا ہوں؟"},{"ar":"C'est trop cher.","roman":"say troh SHAIR","en":"It's too expensive.","ur":"یہ بہت مہنگا ہے۔"},{"ar":"Vous avez moins cher ?","roman":"voo zah-VAY mwan SHAIR","en":"Do you have something cheaper?","ur":"کیا کچھ سستا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Je le prends.","roman":"zhuh luh PRAHN","en":"I'll take it.","ur":"میں یہ لوں گا۔"},{"ar":"En espèces.","roman":"ahn ness-PESS","en":"In cash.","ur":"نقد۔"},{"ar":"Un sac, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"uhn SAHK, seel voo PLAY","en":"A bag, please.","ur":"ایک تھیلا، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Où est le supermarché ?","roman":"oo ay luh sü-pair-mar-SHAY","en":"Where is the supermarket?","ur":"سپر مارکیٹ کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"C'est fermé le dimanche ?","roman":"say fair-MAY luh dee-MAHNSH","en":"Is it closed on Sunday?","ur":"کیا یہ اتوار کو بند ہوتا ہے؟"}]},
{"id":"fr-l09","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":9,"title":"Directions & transport","phrases":[{"ar":"Où est la gare ?","roman":"oo ay lah GAR","en":"Where is the train station?","ur":"ریلوے اسٹیشن کہاں ہے؟"},{"ar":"Pour aller à l'hôtel ?","roman":"poor ah-LAY ah loh-TEL","en":"How do I get to the hotel?","ur":"ہوٹل کیسے جاؤں؟"},{"ar":"Tout droit.","roman":"too DRWAH","en":"Straight ahead.","ur":"سیدھا۔"},{"ar":"À gauche. / À droite.","roman":"ah GOHSH. / ah DRWAHT","en":"Left. / Right.","ur":"بائیں۔ / دائیں۔"},{"ar":"C'est loin ?","roman":"say LWAN","en":"Is it far?","ur":"کیا یہ دور ہے؟"},{"ar":"À cinq minutes à pied.","roman":"ah sank mee-NÜT ah PYAY","en":"Five minutes on foot.","ur":"پیدل پانچ منٹ۔"},{"ar":"Un billet pour Lyon, s'il vous plaît.","roman":"uhn bee-YAY poor lee-OHN, seel voo PLAY","en":"A ticket to Lyon, please.","ur":"لیون کا ایک ٹکٹ، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Un aller-retour.","roman":"uhn nah-lay ruh-TOOR","en":"A return ticket.","ur":"آنے جانے کا ٹکٹ۔"},{"ar":"Quel quai ?","roman":"kel KAY","en":"Which platform?","ur":"کون سا پلیٹ فارم؟"},{"ar":"Ce train s'arrête à Lille ?","roman":"suh tran sah-RET ah LEEL","en":"Does this train stop at Lille?","ur":"کیا یہ ٹرین لِیل پر رکتی ہے؟"},{"ar":"Où est le métro ?","roman":"oo ay luh may-TROH","en":"Where is the metro?","ur":"میٹرو کہاں ہے؟"}]},
{"id":"fr-l10","type":"lesson","lang":"fr","level":"Starter","day":10,"title":"Small talk & work","phrases":[{"ar":"Je suis ingénieur informatique.","roman":"zhuh swee zan-zhay-NYUHR an-for-mah-TEEK","en":"I'm an IT engineer.","ur":"میں آئی ٹی انجینئر ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Je travaille à Dubaï.","roman":"zhuh trah-VY ah doo-BY","en":"I work in Dubai.","ur":"میں دبئی میں کام کرتا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Qu'est-ce que vous faites dans la vie ?","roman":"kess-kuh voo FET dahn lah VEE","en":"What do you do for a living?","ur":"آپ کیا کام کرتے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"J'apprends le français.","roman":"zhah-prahn luh frahn-SAY","en":"I'm learning French.","ur":"میں فرانسیسی سیکھ رہا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Je parle un peu français.","roman":"zhuh parl uhn puh frahn-SAY","en":"I speak a little French.","ur":"میں تھوڑی فرانسیسی بولتا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Il fait beau aujourd'hui.","roman":"eel fay BOH oh-zhoor-DWEE","en":"The weather is nice today.","ur":"آج موسم اچھا ہے۔"},{"ar":"Il fait froid !","roman":"eel fay FRWAH","en":"It's cold!","ur":"ٹھنڈ ہے!"},{"ar":"Vous avez des enfants ?","roman":"voo zah-VAY day zahn-FAHN","en":"Do you have children?","ur":"کیا آپ کے بچے ہیں؟"},{"ar":"Oui, j'ai deux enfants.","roman":"wee, zhay duh zahn-FAHN","en":"Yes, I have two children.","ur":"جی، میرے دو بچے ہیں۔"},{"ar":"C'est intéressant !","roman":"say tan-tay-ray-SAHN","en":"That's interesting!","ur":"یہ دلچسپ ہے!"},{"ar":"Bon week-end !","roman":"bohn week-END","en":"Have a good weekend!","ur":"ہفتے کا اختتام اچھا گزرے!"},{"ar":"À demain !","roman":"ah duh-MAN","en":"See you tomorrow!","ur":"کل ملتے ہیں!"}]}
]
